  "description": "Two-bed house (1 double, 1 single) in walk-in condition with own driveway and back garden, just 5 minutes' walk from Cabra Luas stop.\n\nCosy terraced house situated in a quiet cul-de-sac, with driveway parking space for one car.\n\nSitting room with shelving and under-stairs storage. \n\nSeparate kitchen with tiled floor, gas cooker and oven, fridge-freezer, dishwasher and microwave, table and chairs. Washer-dryer to rear of house.\n\nLarge bedroom with double bed, wardrobe and hot press. \n\nGood size second single bedroom with wardrobe and storage. Currently in use as an office space.\n\nBathroom with electric shower, sink, toilet, and storage.\n\nLarge, south-facing, paved back garden with wooden shed, planter boxes and space to relax.\n\nThis property has been insulated and renovated throughout, with new front and back doors and A-rated window glass. A-rated gas boiler so the house is quick and economical to heat.\n\nExcellent public transport links.\n\n5-minute walk to Cabra Luas stop, 15-minute cycle or bus to city centre. 10 minute walk to Phibsboro. 20 minute walk to Drumcondra, Stoneybatter, Smithfield or Phoenix Park. \n\nEnquiries by email only please. \n\nPlease tell us a little about the people who will be living in the house in your response.",
